usage: bog-nav.py [bog] slot [-h] [--json] [--csv] [--limit N] [--src SRC] [--no-defaults]
                             ref [slotname]

positional arguments:
  ref            path or h:handle
  slotname       a specific slot

options:
  -h, --help     show this help message and exit
  --json         machine JSON output
  --csv          CSV output (header + rows)
  --limit, -n N  print at most N rows (default: all); the cut is reported
  --src SRC      module src root: fill a bog-absent type from @NiagaraProperty
  --no-defaults  do not list the type defaults of the slots absent from the bog (organized/
                 catalog)
